Permissions:
  Call language models
  Run catalog tool "ls"
  Run catalog tool "grep"

prompt equals "Return only a JSON object with tool_id set to ls and arguments set to a list containing -1. No other fields."
Ask the model with prompt expecting json as tool_request
Run catalog tool tool_request as tool_result
Require exit_code of tool_result equals 0 otherwise fail with "The local program failed."
Respond with "Local tool completed."
